          "sent_mt": "2026-08-15T15:45:02-06:00",
          "text": "I just talked to Curt Willis, we will start changing over to clean the line and have everything ready Monday morning for the belt replacement.\n\nChris Givens, Chris Jeffs, William  Lopez. Can we schedule for conveyors and equipment to replace the belt first thing Monday morning",
